From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 06:43:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] d3d11: Implement CreateDirect3D11DeviceFromDXGIDevice() and
 CreateDirect3D11SurfaceFromDXGISurface().

The WinRT APIs that take Direct3D objects (Windows.Graphics.Capture
among them) take these wrappers: an IDirect3DDevice or IDirect3DSurface
holding the DXGI object until closed, handing it back through
IDirect3DDxgiInterfaceAccess, agile.  The interop header now declares
the surface function too, and both stdcall as the SDK does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

